With these two edits in place:

1. `get('id')` will no longer be treated as a regular property lookup.
2. The CPU evaluator will call the feature’s `getId()` (or `.id`) when `get('id')` is encountered.
3. We avoid adding `"id"` to the shader/CPU property list, so you don’t need to duplicate the id in your GeoJSON properties.
